    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you cast Spare the Dying, you can modify the spell so that it sends a jolt of electricity through the target, reviving it. The target regains 1 Hit Point, and each creature in a 10-foot Emanation originating from the target makes a Dexterity saving throw against your spell save DC, taking Lightning damage equal to 1d4 plus half your Artificer level (round up) on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p><p>You can modify the spell this way a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier, and you regain all expended uses wh</p>",
